The instrumentation applied to the subject venv for evidence/rmsnorm-blocksize.json.

Not part of this repository's engine. Apply against
  <subject-venv>/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm/model_executor/layers/batch_invariant.py
of a stock vLLM 0.26.0, whose sha256 is
  2cfcd9ac7d9b954155f012ba44ac21f970ea28ab770248037a00988725176f98
which patches to
  7b2de9c35e5261a07f94397f3ad0dedd1e59d5eee19977286f924814c9d1ad67
The artifact records both digests, so which of the two ran is checkable rather
than remembered. The venv was restored to stock after the runs; keeping a
silently patched engine around is the same defect this work exists to document.

Inert unless LOCKSTEP_RMSNORM_TRACE is set, which certify/session.py does via
--rmsnorm-trace.

